{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":[" "],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"AlMoutmag","text":"<p>MCP Secure Tunnel</p>"},{"location":"#features","title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>95078 tools</li> <li>12 security layers</li> <li>OAuth 2.1 + DPoP</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#install","title":"Install","text":"<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/mohammadfhgjvhgi/almoutmag-v8.git\npip install -e .\npython main.py --dev --port 8452\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"faq/","title":"FAQ","text":""},{"location":"faq/#free","title":"Free?","text":"<p>Yes Community is free. Pro is paid.</p>"},{"location":"faq/#open-source","title":"Open source?","text":"<p>No proprietary.</p>"},{"location":"faq/#linux","title":"Linux?","text":"<p>Coming soon.</p>"},{"location":"install/","title":"Installation","text":""},{"location":"install/#requirements","title":"Requirements","text":"<ul> <li>Python 3.12+</li> <li>Windows 10/11</li> <li>cloudflared</li> </ul>"},{"location":"install/#run","title":"Run","text":"<pre><code>python main.py --dev --port 8452\ncloudflared tunnel --protocol http2 --url http://127.0.0.1:8452 --no-autoupdate\n</code></pre> <p>Important: always use --protocol http2</p>"},{"location":"pricing/","title":"Pricing","text":"Plan Price Features Community Free 95K tools + 10 layers Pro \\/mo + Federation + fleet Team \\/mo + 20 devices Enterprise Contact + on-prem"},{"location":"user-guide/","title":"User Guide","text":""},{"location":"user-guide/#connect-claude-desktop","title":"Connect Claude Desktop","text":"<p>Edit claude_desktop_config.json:</p> <pre><code>{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"almoutmag\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://TUNNEL-URL/mcp\",\n      \"headers\": { \"Authorization\": \"Bearer TOKEN\" }\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"user-guide/#troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","text":"<ul> <li>Tunnel: use --protocol http2</li> <li>Server: check tunnel_logs/server.err</li> </ul>"}]}